["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Coinbase’s Everything Exchange: Agentic Finance, Stablecoins, and Tokenization with CEO Brian Armstrong Everything Exchange X402 agentic finance epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nopriors-给-ai-代理开户-信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f9f8b9697bf1eed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 代理開戶：信用卡手續費撐不起機器經濟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coinbase 想讓每個 AI 代理都有自己的賬戶：76% 的機器支付在 30 美分以下，而信用卡的最低手續費恰好就是 30 美分——舊支付軌道撐不起機器經濟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密支付</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>結婚前先做花錢測試：緊手和揮霍者互相吸引，也更容易離婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花錢的人分成緊手和揮霍者，兩端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚後金錢衝突更多、婚姻滿意度更低；婚禮花得越多，離婚風險反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人財務</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | #426 tightwad spendthrift anticipatory pain of paying financial infidelity unconflicted consumer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-婚礼花得越多离婚率越高-最省的那批人反而最稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>婚禮花得越多離婚率越高，最省的那批人反而最穩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究顯示婚禮花費越低離婚率越低，低於一千美元的那批人離婚率最低；而訂婚戒指花得越多，男性離婚風險越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">婚姻財務</span><span class=\"tag\">消費心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也養出了放貸人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高達 4 億美元，卻沒有選秀、允許 16 歲前私下籤約，於是催生了一個向球員家庭放高利貸的影子產業，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一環。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育產業</span><span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆蟲正在消失，但殺蟲劑不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆蟲數量下降被反覆質疑誇大，但全球數據仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的兇手不是農業，而是普通人隨手買來用的殺蟲劑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生態</span><span class=\"tag\">昆蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我們給殘障人寫「爽文」戲劇，把健全人寫成弱勢群體 原罪人 鏡面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>殘障劇團讓健全人當被歧視的少數，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社會關係整個調轉過來：核戰後多數人成了改造人，少數沒改造的健全人成了原罪人，要爭取權利的反倒是他們。這不是訴苦，是給殘障人寫的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殘障</span><span class=\"tag\">戲劇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Archive: Plato&#x27;s Republic Thrasymachus the Forms the cave the ring of Gyges tripartite soul demagogue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-inourtime-柏拉图理想国-民主离暴政只差一个煽动家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">50:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉圖理想國：民主離暴政只差一個煽動家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉圖認為民主制內部就埋著滑向暴政的通道，被野心家利用只是時間問題；而正義不是外在行為，是靈魂內部的秩序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Genes &amp; the Inheritance of Memories Across Generations | Dr. Oded Rechavi Weismann barrier C. elegans small RNAs RNA interference epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-huberman-获得性遗传在线虫已被证实-人类还没有证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8f8083a6d5296169-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>獲得性遺傳在線蟲已被證實，人類還沒有證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">教科書用魏斯曼屏障解釋為什麼練出的肌肉傳不下去；但在線蟲裡，敲掉後代自己造小 RNA 的能力，它們仍能抵抗父母遇過的病毒，只改大腦裡的 RNA 就能改變三代後的行為。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表觀遺傳</span><span class=\"tag\">線蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Robert A. Wilson, &quot;Kin Matters: Relational Beings in the Fragile Sciences&quot; (Oxford UP, 2026) progenerative view Westermark hypothesis separatism extended cognition homeostatic property cluster disciplinary groove\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nbphilosophy-亲属关系不是文化发明-而是生殖事实的文化延展/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>親屬關係不是文化發明，而是生殖事實的文化延展</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類學家說親屬關係純屬文化建構，哲學家卻指出：女性先懷孕後生育這類生殖事實跨文化通用，親屬制度是對它們的文化延展，連亂倫迴避也不是人類獨有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人類學</span><span class=\"tag\">親屬關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Organized Retail Crime at Big Box Stores shrink ORC (organized retail crime) boosters fence INFORM Act edge analytics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-oddlots-偷来的货能卖到原价七八折-零售盗窃已经产业化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>偷來的貨能賣到原價七八折，零售盜竊已經產業化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被盜商品要經過兩層手：boosters 被招募進店偷貨，fence 負責清洗標識和轉售，之後掛上二手平臺。聯網的贓物能賣到原價七八折，T 恤和除臭劑只剩三成多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售損耗</span><span class=\"tag\">有組織零售犯罪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How baseball got its beat walk-up song seventh inning stretch Tin Pan Alley closer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-throughline-棒球场的音乐不是伴奏-是球迷抢回比赛的方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f35a52e32ee13fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>棒球場的音樂不是伴奏，是球迷搶回比賽的方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">棒球官方史學家嫌球場音樂太吵，但正是球迷齊唱 Hey Hey Goodbye 把客隊投手唱到手軟——音樂讓觀眾從看客變成比賽的一部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">棒球</span><span class=\"tag\">現場體驗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Iron Age Ireland sacral kingship Fianna currach opidum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-ancients-爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵-只有贸易和语言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef50c48b77dede87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>愛爾蘭鐵器時代沒有凱爾特人入侵，只有貿易和語言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統說法認為凱爾特人帶著鐵器在公元前500年入侵愛爾蘭，但考古幾乎找不到外來移民的痕跡——凱爾特身份其實是青銅時代晚期海上貿易網絡裡慢慢長出來的語言共同體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">愛爾蘭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of Stamford Bridge Explained berserk chape house carls Varangian Guard Doomsday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-historyhit-斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销-考古刚找到战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc50d2d1c5ba1e0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">31:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福橋大捷被黑斯廷斯一筆勾銷，考古剛找到戰場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1066年9月，英王哈羅德四天急行軍約200英里，全殲哈拉爾德·哈德拉達的維京大軍；但這場足以奠定任何君主聲望的勝利，幾天後就被黑斯廷斯的慘敗徹底抹去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">維京時代</span><span class=\"tag\">1066年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"394. Road To 9/11: Hijackers, CIA Failures, and America’s Darkest Day (Part 6) cock-up view of history muscle hijackers casing videotape the wall ghazia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-empirehist-cia-提前数月警告-白宫为何还是没拦住-9-11/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>CIA 提前數月警告，白宮為何還是沒攔住 9/11</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情報系統把戰略預警做到了極致，但決策者可以選擇無視——這是 9/11 前七個月真正的失敗點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情報失靈</span><span class=\"tag\">組織決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"704. Roman Civil War: Master of the Republic (Part 4) proscription lictor tribunate adulescentulus carnifex Campus Martius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-restishistory-苏拉用血洗罗马-却亲手为凯撒铺好了路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>蘇拉用血洗羅馬，卻親手為凱撒鋪好了路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇拉是第一個帶兵打進羅馬的人，他贏了內戰、當上獨裁官、又主動退位。但他打破的禁忌再也收不回來——凱撒說他是傻瓜，因為他交出了獨裁權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">內戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Considering a Career Change? How About FINFLUENCER? finfluencer RIA Roth IRA cringe phase top of funnel W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-mastersinbiz-做金融网红不是当网红-是把社媒当漏斗顶端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb210b1031bb956-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>做金融網紅不是當網紅，是把社媒當漏斗頂端</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tyler Gardner 從教師轉行做理財顧問，再轉做金融內容，做到 600 萬粉絲。他的判斷是：短視頻只是漏斗頂端，真正的資產是你能自己擁有的郵件列表和長內容。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">金融內容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5 Solo Founders Called In With Their Hardest Problem | Solo Founders Office Hours RL environment jobs to be done GMV ERP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-solofounders-单人创始人最缺的不是人手-是有人逼你说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f64dfbc7c597bfb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人最缺的不是人手，是有人逼你說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Julian 給五位單人創始人的診斷幾乎都指向同一件事：沒有聯合創始人，你就失去了那個逼你面對「今天到底做了什麼」的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11 Marketing Rules every Creator needs to know: Kate Tolo bouncer ticket price yes and\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-colinsamir-把内容当夜店-算法是保安-你唯一的工作是让他放你进去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac1190aacdd40897-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Colin and Samir</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>把內容當夜店：算法是保安，你唯一的工作是讓他放你進去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kate Tolo 用五年把 Brian Johnson 從 2000 粉做到千萬粉，她的核心比喻是：算法是夜店保安，只在乎場內的人玩得開不開心，你失敗一百次也沒人看見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容策略</span><span class=\"tag\">增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Can AI help us better predict the weather? numerical weather prediction GraphCast GenCast functional generative networks spaghetti plots load forecasting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-deepmind-ai-预报飓风提前一周锁定五级-靠的是统计不是物理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.simplecastcdn.com/images/69d76c2c-4017-4f2f-8838-a33d03d55657/ba57c63a-db75-4c9c-a506-a4bba82c41d1/3000x3000/cropped_1788889769029.jpg?aid=rss_feed\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 預報颶風提前一週鎖定五級，靠的是統計不是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統數值預報靠解流體方程，AI 靠從歷史天氣裡學統計規律。颶風 Melissa 在還是熱帶低壓時就被模型以約 80% 置信度鎖定為五級，比傳統模型更早更狠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 天氣預測</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ashurbanipal cuneiform colophon Neo-Assyrian Sardanapalus Bisitun inscription\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-stuffmissed-亚述巴尼拔的图书馆-他既是暴君-也是最早的藏书家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>亞述巴尼拔的圖書館：他既是暴君，也是最早的藏書家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亞述巴尼拔一邊把敵國國王關進狗窩、逼人用祖先骨頭做磚，一邊建起人類最早的系統性圖書館，讓《吉爾伽美什史詩》活到今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">考古</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>沒有不可替代的領袖，只有不可替代的運氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德研究領袖五十年，結論是長期看沒有哪個領袖不可替代——成吉思汗只是恰好生在兩千年來最溼潤的草原上，換個人也許一樣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 對普通人是舍入誤差：擴散要五十年，反彈卻等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工業革命給普通人便宜衣服和縫紉機，AI 目前只給普通人好玩的圖片和更好的搜索——好處太間接，而政治反彈來得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 擴散</span><span class=\"tag\">公眾認知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公開榜單測不出模型真實能力，第三方評測才是剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公開榜單上表現驚人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上卻是不達標——自報成績和真實能力之間的裂縫，正在催生一個獨立的評測行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI評測</span><span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Meteorology (WEATHER &amp; CLIMATE) Encore with Marshall Shepherd Clausius-Clapeyron equation wet bulb globe temperature bombogenesis atmospheric river ENSO AMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-ologies-天气预报准确率-95-但没人相信它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>天氣預報準確率 95%，但沒人相信它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氣象學家說預報三到五天內有 95% 準確率，公眾只記住被淋溼的那一次；氣候不是未來時，是現在進行時。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣象</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候傳播</span>\n</div></div></a>"]